# Type

`modules/{context}/types/{name}.type.ts`: a view model the screen needs and the API does not return as-is.

```ts
export type OnboardingWorkspace = FindOnboardingOutputDtoType & {
  organizationId: string;
  organizationName: string;
};
```

If the shape matches a DTO, use the type from `@workspace/validation`; never alias it locally.

Props types stay above the component ([component](./component.mdc)).
